  "title": "Blissful Rosemary Chicken",
  "description": "An elegant and intensely flavorful way to prepare chicken breasts: roll with prosciutto and cheese, skewer with rosemary sprigs, and marinate (or not).",
  "authors": [
    "CHEFSINGLEDAD"
  ],
